a430efeb561e2_1740952413616012249.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"彩鹞栉春风 其一「风莺梳春，开天呈祥」\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500854/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500854/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e彩鹞栉春风 其一「风莺梳春，开天呈祥」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e、\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500893\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/02/09/4746485/cf497268dc5b5b2437aa430efeb561e2_7013739423349314796.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"彩鹞栉春风 其三「故鸢吹归，再宿堂楼」\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500893/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500893/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e彩鹞栉春风 其三「故鸢吹归，再宿堂楼」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3882","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"contents\":{\"31c3pp2656cT1717770253128\":{\"option\":\"【再见。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e再见！玩得开心哦，祝你海灯节快乐！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"option\":\"【扎风筝的手艺…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我还没跟你详细说过舅妈阿山婆的事吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我们家人多少都会扎点风筝。但要说手艺最好的，还得是我舅妈，她对风筝真叫一个「痴迷」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e想当初她教我那些传统纹样的时候，眼里都是泛着光的。我好好地听，好好地学着，也不知道自己有朝一日能不能赶上她。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呵呵…你没见她都这么大人了，扎风筝的时候嘴角总还挂着笑意呢！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要是我家孩子愿意的话呀，这门手艺，我也想让我家孩子继承下去…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【第四次海灯节（2024）期间】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ez34bcr32fwT1718035647743\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e欢迎欢迎，小店风筝样式又新又全，请随便看看吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"option\":\"【想看看风筝。】——打开商店界面\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e来，都在这儿了，请慢慢挑选，我给您折扣价。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/07/75981509/11ee64c710e3b091256c0d349ac55461_4999294392722669648.png\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"option\":\"【这里的风筝…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哦。你问这些风筝是从哪儿来的吗？都是我和我的家人亲手扎的！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你放心，我从小跟着舅妈阿山婆学做风筝，这一行前前后后做了有十几年，风筝品质不会有半点问题。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e听说今年海灯节以风筝为主题，可把我舅妈乐坏了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e但她又在信里向我絮叨，说她折腾不来枫丹的新装置。我这才跑来璃月港，帮着一起做生意。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e扎风筝也算我们家的祖传手艺了，喜欢的话，就请多带点走哦！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"31c3pp2656cT1717770253128\":[],\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"ez34bcr32fwT1718035647743\"],\"ez34bcr32fwT1718035647743\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\",\"31c3pp2656cT1717770253128\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1718038140","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1210","pos":"banner"},{"id":"3885","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"694","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1211","pos":"left"},{"id":"1212","pos":"right"}],"name":"七圣召唤挑战","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"}]}]},"edit_lock_status":"Unlock","correct_lock_status":"Unlock","menus":[{"id":"20","name":"NPC\u0026商店","has_page":false,"style":"","sub_menus":[],"icon":"","mi18n_key":"NPC\u0026商店","is_hidden":false,"parent_id":"189","template_id":"","bg_img":"","ch_ext":"[{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"每行个数\",\"attribute_key\":\"col_per_row\",\"value\":\"2\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"展示样式\",\"attribute_key\":\"display_type\",\"value\":\"avatar\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"频道icon\",\"attribute_key\":\"icon_url\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"跳转链接\",\"attribute_key\":\"jump_url\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"频道icon-pc\",\"attribute_key\":\"icon_url_pc\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"频道icon-pc-hover\",\"attribute_key\":\"icon_url_pc_hover\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"att